:: Noah Hang Out Park Sit & Chat [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 10>>
You sit down on the bench and tap the spot next to you, motioning for <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> to sit down. Instead, he stands in front of you awkwardly. Confused, you ask him if he doesn’t want to sit down. Instead of responding with words, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> instead looks down towards your lap. You put the piece together and laugh, grabbing <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> and placing him on your legs. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Thank you!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> says happily, wrapping your arms around him. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Your softer than the bench.”</span> <br>

<<set _ad to [
    {
        Name: "Noah",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Happy",
            Outfit: "Everyday",
        },
    },
    {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Happy",
        },
    },
]>>
