        <<set _random to random(1, 2)>>
        <<if _random == 1>>
            You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> how school is going. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“It’s pretty cool. I think I like it better than our old school.”</span> He replies. You had nearly forgotten that the year prior, you and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> went to the same elementary school, though you never saw each other besides before and after. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“The teachers are nice, but a little strict. Did you know they’re allowed to spank us?”</span> He says in a hushed tone. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Like, bare butt! They can see your thingy and everything! They don’t do it in front of anyone else, but it still sounds embarrassing.”</span> You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> share a laugh. <br>
            <<socialChange "Noah" 1>>
