            [[Continue|Noah Hang Out Park]]
        <<else>>
            You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> if he’s been making friends at school and he nods. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yeah! I have lots of friends! They are really cool, but my best friend is <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Caleb</span>. He’s super cool! He wears this jacket with a bear on it and when he puts the hood up, he looks like a bear! I want one like that!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> laughs, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“We play together every day. He’s the best!”</span> <br>
            <<socialChange "Noah" 1>>
