                 <span style="Color: Pink">With a smirk, you place your hand on <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span>’s crotch and ask how his pokey situation has been since you shared a night together.</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> instantly giggles, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Don’t touch it here!”</span> He shoves your hands away, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I don’t want anyone to see!”</span> You laugh, apologizing, but ask your question again. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hmm…”</span> He thinks for a moment, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“It still does it, but touching it makes it feel really good. I can’t lick it like you do, since my tongue is too short, but sometimes…”</span>  <span style="Color: Pink"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> blushes a little, giving you a shy smile and whispering the next part,</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sometimes I rub it or Bue rubs it and it feels really, really good. Bue’s really good at rubbing it, though I think you’re the best at that.”</span>  <span style="Color: Pink">You can’t help but smile as you share this naughty secret with your little brother.</span> <br>
